pragma solidity ^0.8.34;

// Test categories
// - Unit tests: validate isolated contract logic
// - Integration tests: validate interactions across multiple contracts
// - Forked tests: run against a forked network state
// - Staging tests: run on a live testnet or mainnet environment

// Advanced testing techniques
// - Fuzz tests: validate behavior across randomized inputs
// - Stateful fuzz tests: validate behavior across randomized sequences of actions
// - Stateless fuzz tests: validate single-call behavior with randomized inputs
// - Formal verification: mathematically prove expected properties and invariants
